sequenceDiagram
  participant Sched as scheduler.run_nvd_incremental_sync
  participant NVD as feeds/nvd.py
  participant DB as database.upsert_cves
  participant T as cves table
  participant API as GET /api/cves
  participant APIjs as api.js
  participant Feed as CVEFeed.jsx
  participant Card as CVECard.jsx

  Sched->>NVD: fetch NVD updates (via api_queue + resilient_client)
  NVD-->>Sched: parsed CVE dicts
  Sched->>DB: upsert_cves
  DB->>T: merge rows
  Feed->>APIjs: fetchCVEs with filters
  APIjs->>API: GET /api/cves?page&filters
  API->>T: SELECT paginated
  T-->>API: rows
  API-->>APIjs: page of CVEs + X-Request-ID
  APIjs-->>Feed: CVE list
  Feed->>Card: render list

  Note over Feed: On failure (A3/A5): inline error state<br/>with message + ref link + retry button;<br/>notifyApiError toast for transient failures.<br/>Momentum defaults to 0 until drawer opens.
